# OSS clone manifest for the Phase 1 §17 validation set (20 projects) plus the
# R-01..R-07 feature corpus (#323; selection rationale in
# docs/dev/oss-validation-report.md).
#
# Used by scripts/clone-oss-fixtures.sh to populate target/oss-clones/<slug>,
# then by scripts/oss-metrics.sh to measure false-positive rate and cold-run
# speed against the §17 exit criteria.
#
# Tab-separated columns (lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored):
#   slug      directory name under target/oss-clones/ and report key
#   category  library | cli | app | server | framework | rest  (for the report)
#   size      small | medium | large
#             The §17 "cold run <= 2s" gate applies to `medium` projects;
#             large projects are reported for information only.
#   ref       commit SHA to pin (40 hex), with the release tag in the comment
#             block above its section. A tag or branch also works, and empty
#             means default branch HEAD, but either can move upstream; a SHA
#             cannot. clone-oss-fixtures.sh records the checked-out SHA in
#             clones.lock.tsv.
#   url       https clone URL (without trailing .git)
#
# The mix follows §17: Django app / FastAPI app / library / monorepo blend.
#
# slug	category	size	ref	url
#
# Pinned by commit SHA; the release tag:
#   requests             v2.32.3
#   urllib3              2.2.3
#   click                8.1.7
#   jinja                3.1.4
#   werkzeug             3.0.4
#   flask                3.0.3
#   httpx                0.27.2
#   starlette            0.38.6
#   uvicorn              0.30.6
#   attrs                24.2.0
#   anyio                4.6.0
#   python-dotenv        v1.0.1
#   tenacity             8.5.0
#   structlog            24.4.0
#   pluggy               1.5.0
#   typer                0.12.5
#   black                24.8.0
#   fastapi              0.115.0
#   djangorestframework  3.15.2
#   django               5.1.1
